Installation from source hints

Required Debian packages:
autoconf
bison
zlib1g-dev
libncurses-dev

libreadline-5 must be installed from source or an older Debian package
Build the version in ~/linux/readline/readline-5.2-mbari

Once these all all installed:

espinstall

will install ESP Ruby under /opt/mbari
Add /opt/mbari/bin to your $PATH
